---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy | devsyllabus"
  description="devsyllabus cookie policy: the site sets no tracking cookies, and site search runs entirely in your browser."
  path="/cookie-policy/"
>
  <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ label: 'Cookie Policy' }]} />

  <div class="doc">
  <h1>Cookie policy</h1>
  <p>Last updated: 2026-09-04</p>

  <h2>Current state: no cookies</h2>
  <p>
    devsyllabus currently sets no cookies. The site has no accounts, no
    preferences to remember, and no tracking. Site search stores nothing
    — it runs in your browser against an index that ships with the page.
  </p>

  <h2>If cookies are added later</h2>
  <p>
    Should the site ever need cookies (for example, remembered filters),
    this page will list each cookie, its purpose, and its lifetime before
    it goes live, and we will prefer functional cookies over tracking
    ones.
  </p>

  <h2>Browser storage</h2>
  <p>
    The search page may use your browser's memory only for the duration
    of the page visit; nothing persists after you close the tab.
  </p>

  <p>
    See also the <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> and
    <a href="/terms-of-use/">terms of use</a>.
  </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
